## Upstream Acknowledgements
whisper.rs is an independent pure-Rust implementation based on the architecture, reference algorithms, and format specifications developed by:
- Georgi Gerganov and the whisper.cpp contributors (https://github.com/ggerganov/whisper.cpp)
- Alec Radford and the OpenAI Whisper research team (https://github.com/openai/whisper)
